  <running_head>PHYSICARUM LIB. X.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>falsum</catchword>
    <signature>Z 5</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">tudinem ad actionem efficienti pro-</l>
    <l n="2">priam. Unde liquet, quare facultates</l>
    <l n="3">animæ rationalis dicantur principia,</l>
    <l n="4">quibus illa est ad agendum efficax.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">§. 3. Solet hic ambigi, <i>quot sint con-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>stituenda facultates animæ rationalis?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">Plerique duas faciunt intellectum &amp;</l>
    <l n="8">voluntatem, quidam tertiam adjun-</l>
    <l n="9">gunt, nempe facultatem exsequendi, a-</l>
    <l n="10">liqui &amp; quartam adjiciunt, nempe me-</l>
    <l n="11">moriam intellectivam. Ego quoque</l>
    <l n="12">quatuor constituendas esse existimo:</l>
    <l n="13">quia tot sunt actiones inter se primo</l>
    <l n="14">diversæ in ordine ad facultates, nempe</l>
    <l n="15">intelligere, memorari, velle, &amp; exse-</l>
    <l n="16">qui. Sed his regerunt aliqui memoriam</l>
    <l n="17">ad intellectum esse revocandam, vel</l>
    <l n="18">memoriam animæ rationali dum in</l>
    <l n="19">corpore est non convenire. Sed contra</l>
    <l n="20">primum est, quod actio memorandi</l>
    <l n="21">diversa sit ab actione intelligendi, &amp;</l>
    <l n="22">nulla appareat ratio quare in anima</l>
    <l n="23">sentiente distinguamus facultatem co-</l>
    <l n="24">gnoscentem &amp; memorantem, non au-</l>
    <l n="25">tem in anima rationali. Et porro si in-</l>
    <l n="26">tellectus non differret a memoria, sem-</l>
    <l n="27">per intelligeret quod semel cognovit,</l>
    <l n="28">vel non posset rursus intelligere, quod</l>
    <l n="29">ante intellexit, nisi de novo ipsi objectum</l>
    <l n="30">obveniret, quorum utrumque</l>
    <l n="31">falsum</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
